  "composer": {
    "accepted_prose": "Hana nodded, brushing a strand of hair behind her ear as she glanced toward the hallway. \"Then let's get you settled first. Take your things to the guest room—the one at the end, with the window facing the garden. I'll have introductions when you're ready, but Yuuni can say hello now if she likes.\"\n\nShe offered a small, reassuring smile. \"You aren't imposing. I want you comfortable before we do anything else.\"\n\nYuuni leaned against the doorframe, tilting her head with a smirk. \"So you're the one with the notebook. I thought you'd look more mysterious.\" Her voice carried a light, teasing lilt. \"It's just a schedule. Don't get any ideas about secret rules for me.\"",
